('northline-hotel','Northline Hotel','Hospitality website','An editorial booking experience for an independent hotel.','A hospitality concept focused on clear room discovery and a direct enquiry path.','Present rooms, location, and the character of the property without burying practical details.','A restrained visual system, direct room comparison, and a prominent booking enquiry.',['Room detail pages','Availability enquiry','Local guide'],['Responsive design','Accessibility','Content architecture']),
