('form-and-found','Form & Found','E-commerce website','A quiet storefront concept for curated home goods.','A shop concept with considered product discovery and a simple checkout journey.','Help customers browse without visual clutter.','A product-led catalog with clear filters and product details.',['Product filters','Product detail','Cart flow'],['UI design','Commerce architecture','Accessibility']),
